 ## Ownership map
 
+Live BTW keeps one logical root session and stores the current native transcript ID in its metadata.
+`lib/liveBtw.ts` owns preparation and publishes that head after the complete snapshot import succeeds.
+The existing-session send path uses the prepared transcript before optimistic insertion and prompt admission.
