+Preparation loads the imported transcript through the shared message loader before publishing that head.
+An optimistic new question must not make an unmaterialized import appear complete.
+The composer owns draft migration when its transcript changes.
+Live imports persist their native transcript order in message metadata.
+The message-ordering helper uses that order before timestamps within the imported session.
+Newly admitted messages follow the imported block.
+Original message timestamps remain available for display.
