+OpenCode excludes the record named by `before`.
+`transcriptCutAfterMessage` selects the first turn boundary after the answer.
+A boundary can be a prompt, compaction, background result, or workflow report.
+With no later boundary, these actions copy the whole transcript.
+A cut visible locally can still be missing on the server.
+An explicit cut retries a 404 once with the same cut and captured runtime.
+A failed retry returns the error to the user.
